#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:7
#: 0b1429a7d1ae4328a762eaf2d9efdac7
msgid ""
"The Skystars H7HDV2 is a flight controller produced by `Skystars "
"<http://www.skystars-rc.com/>`_."
