msgstr "SERIAL8 -> UART8（用户）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:45
#: 8abdb42e942d43c5ba1f3ba672262273
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:46
#: 56faf191340441b09b6ecffc849637d7
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART1 (R1). Unidirectional serial "
"inputs can be directly tied to R1 . Bi-directional protocols require "
"connection to T1 in addition:"
msgstr "默认 RC 输入配置在 UART1（R1）上。单向串行输入可直接连接到 R1。双向协议还需要连接 T1："

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:48
#: 9ba49aace96b44a0bc2689f13603b0f9
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:49
#: a30441823e09438d92e5c6af7956d6c2
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R1 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R1 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:50
#: c5ea8482a01d43dd8fce9e28903f6174
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T1. Set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>`"
" = 7"
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 T1。设置 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:51
#: 9c028499fac542659fd2ecb23f66f998
msgid ""
"CRSF/ELRS also requires both T1 and R1 connections and provides telemetry "
"automatically."
msgstr "CRSF/ELRS 也需要同时连接 T1 和 R1，并自动提供数传功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:54
#: 2e62570607d94833afaafc1ae8df6ff1
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:55
#: 6a8e33c9b9344ae59ce255b7c211f70f
msgid ""
"By default, Skystars H7HDV2 supports OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver) "
"and simultaneously DisplayPort using UART6 on the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Skystars H7HDV2 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD，并同时通过 HD VTX 连接器上的 "
"UART6 支持 DisplayPort。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:58
#: b2c5489f42b240dd87955d34e5c0c699
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:59
#: 2891bc5e805c403ba46a943bb6e80cfb
msgid ""
"The Skystars H7HDV2 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output "
"M1 to M8 on the two motor connectors, plus M9 for LED strip, by default, or "
"another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"Skystars H7HDV2 最多支持9路 PWM 输出。两个电机连接器上的电机输出焊盘 M1 至 M8，加上默认用于 LED 灯带的 "
"M9，或用于其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:61
#: 032d9547a11e42829c615ce549279214
msgid "The PWM is in 5 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为5个组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:63
#: fcbb1fa4dc214ec59704911257da27b8
msgid "PWM 1, 2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 在组1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:64
#: 9bf479c663be470e93b426ec890f375c
msgid "PWM 3, 4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3、4 在组2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:65
#: d5045dd9a2154444bc10d13472d7579e
msgid "PWM 5-8  in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5-8 在组3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:66
#: 7b8cd15c57634354862965815b014a40
msgid "PWM 9    in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9 在组4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:68
#: a75ffc07c7914b268df6de70914356ac
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Outputs 1-8 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。如果某组中的任意通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。输出1-8支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:73
#: 03e9adf63923449692f55bc9db47454b
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:74
#: 6f6b1a1284df44c9bf3579971f3fd673
msgid ""
"The board has a builtin voltage and current sensor. The current sensor can "
"read up to 130 Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "飞控板内置电压和电流传感器。电流传感器最大可读 130A，电压传感器最大支持 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:76
#: 5b7d11bfcd844f81b24e2375f4e21f7e
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:78
#: d834283a9b2a4cf49141cbec94314071
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:79
#: 80ca1f432cf44fa29b873787716c8489
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:80
#: b3ecf6005061410093127de956f4baeb
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11 (CURR pin)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11（CURR 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:81
#: dc5e136459be40baa725b1a581624d94
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10.1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:82
#: 80793223e4534630bac25284393bb707
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 17.0"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 17.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:85
#: 55d9cf51080f477592b697860e74705c
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:86
#: 2f47f09afa14454bb91a4378dd3fe071
msgid ""
"The Skystars H7HDV2 does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "Skystars H7HDV2 没有内置罗盘，但您可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘使用 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:89
#: 0b2939698c2f40d58f5b1a0277d53439
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:90
#: bab7e9868feb4209a3cd492af6a22633
msgid ""
"If the JP jumper is bridged to PIT then GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output "
"to pins marked \"10V\" and is included on the HD VTX connector. Setting this"
" GPIO low removes voltage supply to this pin/pad. RELAY2 is configured by "
"default to control this GPIO and is high by default."
msgstr ""
"如果 JP 跳线桥接到 PIT，则 GPIO 81 控制 VTX BEC 输出到标记为「10V」的引脚，并包含在 HD VTX 连接器上。将此 GPIO"
" 设置为低电平会切断该引脚/焊盘的电源。RELAY2 默认配置为控制此 GPIO，默认为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:93
#: bfd336cf6b7e45bd93a28ec97e8e4e68
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:94
#: e983dc0a2e754a28a192a740ea46da02
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the analogue camera outputs. Setting this GPIO high selects"
" Camera 1, low selects Camera 2. RELAY3 is configured by default to control "
"this GPIO and is high by default."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制模拟相机输出。将此 GPIO 设置为高电平选择相机1，低电平选择相机2。RELAY3 默认配置为控制此 GPIO，默认为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:97
#: 4527ca1a715345a1b6d72b4f0f171cf2
msgid "RSSI"
msgstr "RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:98
#: 4fc2794bd24147d5a25937db6f3b2e1d
msgid ""
"For analog RSSI set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` to \"1\" and "
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` to  \"13\". For RC protocols that report "
"RSSI, set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"对于模拟 RSSI，将 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` "
"设为「1」，:ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` 设为「13」。对于可报告 RSSI 的 RC 协议，将 "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 设为「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:101
#: 5b6aba1ca06d4d0394e34d011cbb78b7
msgid "Additional GPIO"
msgstr "附加 GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:102
#: 9fb417c2d51e4160acf638a940fadb35
msgid ""
"GPIO 83 is marked as \"OSD\". It can be used as a general GPIO pin. By "
"default RELAY4 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high at "
"boot."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 83 标记为「OSD」，可用作通用 GPIO 引脚。默认情况下，RELAY4 配置为控制此引脚，并在启动时将 GPIO 设置为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:105
#: 17b39cd0ee1f4243a931397fcdc7cdb9
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:106
#: 88d6600e4ef847dc9fee5d98aaf27806
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled "
"\"SkystarsH7HDV2\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的「SkystarsH7HDV2」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:108
#: e41480459feb40f6bb34306bdc9376ca
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:112
#: a14d513ec15e4514b6724b8b0bff6eb8
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可以使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
